{
  "bodyHash": "67Gs1L3rQi0=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OVV5lXk.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8ZhXRQ4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/適用於 Minecraft-1.19 | 1.16 | 1.14 | 1.12 | 1.11 | 1.1 | 1.9-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"524\" height=\"28\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/安裝於-僅用戶端-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"210\" height=\"28\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-animations-collection/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689:7498\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3yrSsw7\" width=\"320\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3jr9xQw\" width=\"215\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-animations-collection/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689:7499\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3nRXr4m\" width=\"325\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/30lZmFY\" width=\"208\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3jr9xQw\" width=\"215\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3clkhvn\" width=\"299\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8ZhXRQ4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>📖 關於：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>更好的動畫合集</strong>旨在透過改變遊戲內模型，實現更優質的動畫和細微效果，來提升《Minecraft》的遊戲氛圍。它致力於為遊戲中能因此受益的部分增添更真實的感受，例如模擬物理運動，並讓原本不會動的模型部件活動起來。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8ZhXRQ4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>📚 內容：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>搖擺的地獄幽靈觸手</strong>將地獄幽靈的觸手分成數個部件，並讓它們逼真地扭動，就像電影裡常見的那些觸手怪物一樣。讓牠們更有點嚇人，但終究看起來更棒了。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>扭動的魷魚觸手</strong>為魷魚的游泳動畫增添了水母般的效果，同時也讓牠們的觸手在移動時更加飄逸。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>頑皮的狗狗</strong>將狼的尾巴變得更加蓬鬆飄逸，在站立和奔跑時會逼真地搖擺。同時也讓被馴服的狼躺下，而不是坐著。拿點肉舉起來，牠們還會打滾呢。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>飄逸的豹貓尾巴</strong>移除了當前豹貓那根棍子般的尾巴，並賦予牠們更漂亮的尾巴。完全動畫化的飄逸尾巴，在站立或奔跑時都會擺動。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>捲曲的貓尾巴</strong>將豹貓引以為傲的那些美麗動畫飄逸尾巴也帶給了貓咪。而且還不止如此；當牠們坐下時，尾巴甚至會繞著身體捲曲起來！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>哼哼豬</strong>添加了一個非常細微的動畫，讓豬在發出哼哼聲時，牠的鼻子會跟著動。只是非常輕微地上下移動，但確實存在。為你的牲畜增添多一點生氣。也別忘了那飄動的耳朵！對這麼小的動物來說，耳朵還真不小。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>晃動的牛乳房</strong>讓牛在走路時，乳房會跟著晃動。同時也為乳房加上了乳頭，但如果你對這類內容較敏感，也可以將其關閉。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>咯咯叫的雞</strong>讓雞在咯咯叫時，嘴巴會張開閉合。嘴巴也變得更加纖細，所以再也不會把雞跟鴨搞混了！而當牠們昂首闊步時，頭部會前後移動，下巴的肉垂會搖晃，翅膀也會稍微拍動。就跟真的一樣！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>扭動的村民鼻子</strong>帶來了一個微妙的變化，讓村民在發出他們獨特的「嗯~」聲音時，會扭動他們的大鼻子！這是個小改變，但誰能不覺得有趣呢？</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>扭動的鐵魔像鼻子</strong>與上述完全相同，只是對象換成了鐵魔像！由於牠們不會發出任何聲音，因此改為在受到傷害時鼻子會扭動。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>顫動的液態史萊姆</strong>帶來了令人愉悅的視覺變化：讓史萊姆的內部像液體一樣流動。當牠們跳躍時，會更加地「撲通撲通」晃動。眼睛、嘴巴和核心本身都會獨立移動。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>岩漿立方怪漢堡</strong>為岩漿立方怪添加了自定義的死亡動畫，導致牠們死後身體會堆疊成一堆冒著蒸氣、美味的漢堡肉餅。可惜的是，你不能吃掉它們，因為它們實在太燙了。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>蜘蛛膝蓋</strong>是一項真正令人驚嘆的視覺補充。蜘蛛現在終於擁有牠們夢寐以求的膝蓋了。洞穴蜘蛛也同樣受影響。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>搖擺的苦力怕</strong>喚起了人們對多年前由獨一無二的<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCshoKvlZGZ20rVgazZp5vnQ\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">CaptainSparklez</span></a>所製作的<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k2rDbRUDkds\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">那個超紅的音樂錄影帶</span></a>的回憶。還記得那個非常可愛的搖擺苦力怕嗎？嗯，牠現在已經在遊戲裡了。完整版本，貨真價實，就跟影片裡一模一樣。這可能是整個合集中最棒的自訂動畫了。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>揮舞手臂的終界使者</strong>讓憤怒的終界使者在追擊目標時，瘋狂地揮舞手臂。非常符合牠們扭曲的本性：滑稽揮舞、充氣、甩臂的終界使者管狀人！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>動畫雪人手臂</strong>讓雪人在丟雪球時，手臂會跟著揮動。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>屈膝的羊</strong>真的很「膝」奇。它讓羊真的彎下腰來吃草。不再只是頭部降低，而是整個身體壓低，好品嚐一口那多汁的纖維素。你有注意到牠們屈膝時，膝蓋也會彎曲嗎？</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>熟悉的馬</strong>讓馬再次變得更有生氣，就像在舊版本中那樣。做法是在忠於原版模型風格的同時，將嘴巴和膝蓋加回來。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>吐口水的羊駝</strong>讓羊駝在吐口水時會張開嘴巴。牠們之前到底是怎麼做到的？！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>彎曲的人形膝蓋</strong>讓殭屍類和豬布林類生物的膝蓋在走路時會彎曲。看起來非常流暢和舒適。你會喜歡的，相信我。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8ZhXRQ4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>📷 媒體：</strong></span></p><table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/889/2021-07-29_11.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/376/50/2021-06-30_14.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>咯咯叫的雞</strong></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><strong>屈膝的羊</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/756/2021-07-28_21.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/382/106/2021-07-22_13.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>哼哼豬</strong></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><strong>晃動的牛乳房</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/201/2021-07-26_16.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/202/2021-07-26_16.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>熟悉的馬</strong></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><strong>吐口水的羊駝</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/193/2021-07-26_16.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/382/111/2021-07-22_12.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>扭動的村民鼻子</strong></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><strong>扭動的鐵魔像鼻子</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/382/110/2021-07-22_13.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/382/109/2021-07-22_13.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>捲曲的貓尾巴</strong></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><strong>飄逸的豹貓尾巴</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/196/2021-07-26_16.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/382/107/2021-07-22_12.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>頑皮的狗狗</strong></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><strong>動畫雪人手臂</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/382/108/2021-07-22_13.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/190/2021-07-26_16.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>蜘蛛膝蓋</strong></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><strong>顫動的液態史萊姆</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/757/2021-07-26_16.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/758/2021-07-28_09.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>揮舞手臂的終界使者</strong></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><strong>搖擺的苦力怕</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/374/725/2021-06-25_13.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/200/2021-07-26_16.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>扭動的魷魚觸手</strong></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><strong>彎曲的人形膝蓋</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/374/728/2021-06-25_13.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/383/192/2021-07-26_16.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>搖擺的地獄幽靈觸手</strong></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><strong>岩漿立方怪漢堡</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/aQKmdRYwvGk?wmode=transparent\" height=\"231\" width=\"410\"></iframe></span></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/S3oko18JERQ?wmode=transparent\" height=\"231\" width=\"410\"></iframe></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>預告片作者：<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCEq5O5WCb2tTngspsMsyrrQ\" rel=\"nofollow\">Loook</a></strong></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><strong>評測作者：<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC7SktcUK2OPYQwe123rJVbg\" rel=\"nofollow\">JKapGaming</a></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/BS0OOQJ5jQw?wmode=transparent\" height=\"231\" width=\"410\"></iframe></span></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/3I7i7oENjFI?wmode=transparent\" height=\"231\" width=\"410\"></iframe></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>評測作者：<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCyZA5Ysa33gA89sCdWJQojQ\" rel=\"nofollow\">CavemanFilms</a></strong></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><strong>評測作者：<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCKlhpmbHGxBE6uw9B_uLeqQ\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sky Does Everything</a></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/JGk4mXX6QQc?wmode=transparent\" height=\"231\" width=\"410\"></iframe></span></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/qkFSPBTdqXA?wmode=transparent\" height=\"231\" width=\"410\"></iframe></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>評測作者：<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCH-_hzb2ILSCo9ftVSnrCIQ\" rel=\"nofollow\">YOGSCAST Lewis &amp; Simon</a></strong></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><strong>評測作者：<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCshoKvlZGZ20rVgazZp5vnQ\" rel=\"nofollow\">CaptainSparklez</a></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/SEqjHrJlYy4?wmode=transparent\" height=\"231\" width=\"410\"></iframe></span></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/4DYa_7KAdd8?wmode=transparent\" height=\"231\" width=\"410\"></iframe></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>評測作者：<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCS5Oz6CHmeoF7vSad0qqXfw\" rel=\"nofollow\">DanTDM</a></strong></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><strong>評測作者：<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCqg2eLFNUu3QN3dttNeOWkw\" rel=\"nofollow\">iHasCupquake</a></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8ZhXRQ4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>💡 常見問題：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>問：如何設定這個模組？</strong><br><strong>答：</strong>安裝我的<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Config Menus for Forge</strong></span></a>模組，並直接在遊戲內進行設定！</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>問：這能與自訂資源包一起使用嗎？</strong><br><strong>答：</strong> 可以！Better Animations Collection 中的所有內容皆由原版資源構成，未使用任何多餘的材質。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8ZhXRQ4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>🏆 致謝名單：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Better Animations Collection 的開發受益於以下人員的幫助與啟發：</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.minecraftforum.net/members/KodaichiZero\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>KodaichiZero</strong></span></a>：在多年前為 Minecraft 1.2.5 創作了最初的 <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding-java-edition/minecraft-mods/1284100-1-2-5-the-better-animations-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Better Animations Collection</span></a></span> 中這些出色的模型與動畫，功勞幾乎全歸於他。關於繼續開發本專案的書面許可請見<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.imgur.com%252fD7CiEnf.png\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">此處</span></a>。</span></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/tr9zw\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Tr9zw</strong></span></a>：其 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/not-enough-animations\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Not Enough Animations</span></a> 模組中的物品檢視動畫為本作提供了部分靈感。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/almightytallestred\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Almightytallestred</strong></span></a>：其 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/player-eating-animation\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Player Eating Animation</span></a> 模組中的進食動畫為本作提供了部分靈感。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/freshlx_official\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>FreshLX</strong></span></a>：其 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Fresh Animations</span></a> 資源包中飄動的豬耳朵為本作提供了靈感。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcpedl.com%252fuser%252ftrayblock%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>TrayBlock</strong></span></a>：其 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcpedl.com%252fimproved-vanilla-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Improved Vanilla Mobs</span></a> 附加包中纖細的雞喙為本作提供了靈感。</span></li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8ZhXRQ4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/lunapixelstudios/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=CurseForge&amp;message=LunaPixelStudios&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"282\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/LunaPixelStudio\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/LunaPixelStudio?label=Twitter&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=twitter&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"149\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/8ZmhaPPbjE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"220\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1MOyd2u.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"300\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzs_&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzss&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2l26SuCmCNSCPefpfbCX7Q\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzs&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"89\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/Fusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=@Fusseel&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=twitter&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"124\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.reddit.com%252fuser%252fFusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=u/Fusseel&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=reddit&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Reddit\" width=\"130\" height=\"28\"></a> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzs 0212&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"127\" height=\"28\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8ZhXRQ4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http